  "id": "reversal-attempt-fail-01",
  "title": {
    "en": "Reversal Attempt Against an Uptrend",
    "bn": "Uptrend-এর বিরুদ্ধে reversal চেষ্টা"
  },
  "symbol": "EURUSD",
  "timeframe": "H4",
  "mode": "synthetic",
  "type": "trade-setup",
  "bias": "bearish",
  "outcome": "loss",
  "tags": [
    "reversal",
    "counter-trend",
    "failed"
  ],
  "module": "09-price-action-entries-strategies",
  "lessonSlugs": [
    "02-trend-continuation-vs-reversal"
  ],
  "caption": {
    "en": "A long upper wick tempts a sell at the high. The higher lows are still intact, so the trend resumes and the stop hits.",
    "bn": "লম্বা upper wick দেখে high-এ sell। Higher low অক্ষত ছিল, তাই trend ফিরে এসে stop লেগেছে।"
  },
  "notes": {
    "en": "Illustrative synthetic data.",
    "bn": "এটি শিক্ষামূলক কাল্পনিক ডেটা।"
  },
  "explanation": {
    "en": "One rejection candle did not break the structure, so there was no reversal yet.",
    "bn": "একটি rejection candle structure ভাঙেনি, তাই reversal তখনো শুরু হয়নি।"
  },
  "keyTakeaways": [
    {
      "en": "A reversal needs a structure break, not just one wick",
      "bn": "Reversal-এর জন্য structure ভাঙা লাগে, শুধু একটি wick নয়"
    }
  ],
